  "title": "Lemon-Blueberry Loaf",
  "description": "Colorful and tasty, this sweet lemon-blueberry loaf can be enjoyed right away--but it tastes best when wrapped tightly and allowed to sit for a day so the flavors can meld.",
  "authors": [
    "AUNT MAMIE"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:43:11-04:00",
