  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "cooking spray (such as Pam®)",
    "0.75 cup white sugar",
    "0.25 cup butter, melted and slightly cooled",
    "0.25 cup sour cream",
    "2 eggs, beaten",
    "1 medium lemon, zested and juiced, divided",
    "0.33333334326744 cup milk",
    "1.6666667461395 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 teaspoons baking powder",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "1.25 cups frozen blueberries, unthawed",
    "1 tablespoon icing sugar",
    "1 tablespoon lemon juice",
    "1 teaspoon finely grated lemon zest"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Spray a 9x5-inch loaf pan with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/m0pVUUAhoYNRjNFwjy_4vU9p8C8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/277294-lemon-blueberry-loaf-DDMFS-step-01-19c3ae783dac426f81260e230bcfffa0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277294/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk together sugar, melted butter, sour cream, eggs, and lemon juice in a large bowl until thoroughly blended. Mix in milk.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/X-0SzB4dBXzdFp7haBX0GssMYjo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/277294-lemon-blueberry-loaf-DDMFS-step-02-fd958eaf95b0429885e1f45d6e10a661.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277294/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir together flour, baking powder, salt, and lemon zest in a separate bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1HpMPc_s3ODlr7NcRGvxZREwO4k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/277294-lemon-blueberry-loaf-DDMFS-step-03-b5836cfd2084452aacc10aa5ae80075f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277294/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove 2 tablespoons flour mixture and place in a third, smaller bowl with frozen blueberries; stir to coat. Stir remaining flour mixture into milk-sour cream mixture with a rubber spatula or wooden spoon, blending until just combined. Fold floured blueberries into batter and transfer into the prepared loaf pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WnbGsaLicnqXgMa_u0xC_0ts71U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/277294-lemon-blueberry-loaf-DDMFS-step-04-537e404dbc334bef8f1d68389032b07f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277294/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UuVX2OS1ajKfBTGwWf_O2ivFSHM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/277294-lemon-blueberry-loaf-DDMFS-step-05-6751467cede048bf866f1f08abe6dd53.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277294/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, mix together icing sugar, lemon juice, and lemon zest in a small bowl for the topping.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-UwyGElWvAMgxSNJ9Hu1kZQek0A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/277294-lemon-blueberry-loaf-DDMFS-step-06-60d68df64d8e4549a1981add7ec31f4f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277294/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove loaf from the oven and immediately poke holes all over the top with a toothpick. Pour topping over loaf and let cool in the pan for 10 minutes. Remove loaf to a wire rack to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kYRedGfKbNh_IHv3oJJRxYhztSk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/277294-lemon-blueberry-loaf-DDMFS-step-07-0b09a8c916ae4ae68e6e45df091b936c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277294/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
